					+ "Current plan estimates " + planTask.getTargetCompletions() + " runs.",
				null, false, false, false, false));
		}
		ActivityState activity = herbRun.getActivity();
		ReminderState reminder = herbRun.getReminder();
		String status;
		switch (activity.getStatus())
		{
			case ATTENTION:
				status = "Needs attention";
				break;
			case READY:
				status = "Ready";
				break;
			case PARTIALLY_READY:
				status = "Partially ready";
				break;
			case GROWING:
				status = "Growing";
				break;
			case COMPLETE:
				status = "Complete";
				break;
			case UNKNOWN:
			default:
				status = "No active herb run";
				break;
		}
		boolean reminderSnoozed = reminder.getSuppressedUntilEpochMillis() != null
			&& reminder.getSuppressedUntilEpochMillis() > now.toEpochMilli();
		Long dueAt = reminderSnoozed ? reminder.getSuppressedUntilEpochMillis()
			: activity.getStatus() == ActivityStatus.ATTENTION ? null : activity.getReadyAtEpochMillis();
		String detail = activity.getStatus() == ActivityStatus.ATTENTION
			? activity.getProgress() + " herb patches are diseased or dead; healthy patches keep their readiness timer."
			: activity.getTarget() == 0
			? "Plant herbs to start a tracked run. Synced from RuneLite Time Tracking."
			: activity.getProgress() + " of " + activity.getTarget()
				+ " active herb patches ready. Synced from RuneLite Time Tracking.";
		detail += " Current plan estimates " + planTask.getTargetCompletions()
			+ " runs to gather the missing herbs.";
